Rule 2 (x must not be boolean)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 3 (name can be any string)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = "none" ∨ v_2 ≠ "none"
>>
Rule 4 (all tensor dimensions are non-negative if any exist)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ (∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0)
>>
Rule 5 (for non-empty tensors, min is not greater than max)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (∃ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0) ∨ min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
